		{"id":"n_bim_revit","type":"text","text":"### 🏢 BIM Revit C# & IFC\\n\\n- The Building Coder samples & API\\n- `DomCR/ACadSharp`: Đọc DWG/DXF trực tiếp\\n- `NeVeSpl/RevitDBExplorer`: Soi database\\n- `xeokit-sdk` & `bimvie.ws`: WebBIM viewer","x":-1360,"y":1180,"width":420,"height":220,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"n_cad_cam","type":"text","text":"### 📐 CAD & In 3D Tham Số\\n\\n- `flowful-ai/cad-skill`: CadQuery 3D in được\\n- `earthtojake/text-to-cad`: CAD/CAE/CAM\\n- `IfcOpenShell`: Xử lý hình học chuẩn mở\\n- `ViewSuSu/Su.Revit.HelixToolkit.SharpDX`","x":-900,"y":1180,"width":420,"height":220,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"n_ocr_data","type":"text","text":"### 📊 OCR, Docs & Dashboard\\n\\n- Chandra OCR local (:8000, MinIO, Neo4j)\\n- `datalab-to/surya`: Trích xuất layout tài liệu\\n- `apache/echarts`: Trực quan dữ liệu web\\n- `microsoft/markitdown` & `Stirling-PDF`","x":-440,"y":1180,"width":420,"height":220,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"n_cloud_iot","type":"text","text":"### ☁️ Cloud, VPS & IoT\\n\\n- Cloudflare Tunnels, DNS, Access\\n- Tailscale Mesh Admin (:8444, :8445)\\n- Xiaozhi ESP32 Robot Console\\n- Bambu Lab A1 3D Printer MakerWorld","x":20,"y":1180,"width":420,"height":220,"color":"6"}
